  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints : } \\mathrm{P}=2 \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{L}}+\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{M}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{M}}=0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{P}=\\frac{1}{f} \\times 2=\\frac{2}{f} \\\\\n& -\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{~F}}=\\frac{2}{f} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~F}=-\\frac{f}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/rygb0J1g4hQUq9dfyWb0Hi0e2bAfGZ82kwxlIn9TCfY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
